Rule 9 (if deterministic is true then result of API equals true and if deterministic is false then result of API equals false)
{v_1 : bool, v_2 : bool} |= if v_1 = true then v_2 = true else v_2 = false
>>
Rule 10 (if deterministic debug mode is true, then min of tensor is less than max of tensor)
{v_1 : bool, v_2 : tensor} |= if v_1 = true then min(v_2) < max(v_2)
